@startuml
title Agent 工具权限与执行链路

skinparam shadowing false

actor 用户 as User
participant "Agent Chat" as Chat
participant "Agent Runtime" as Runtime
participant "Tool Registry" as Registry
participant "Permission Gate" as Gate
participant "Audit Logger" as Audit
participant "Tool Executor" as Executor
participant "Local Adapter" as Adapter

User -> Chat: 请求 Agent 执行任务
Chat -> Runtime: sendMessage()
Runtime -> Registry: 获取工具定义
Registry --> Runtime: toolId + permissionLevel + schema
Runtime -> Gate: 校验工具、参数、上下文和 Agent 策略

alt Level 0/1 允许
  Gate -> Audit: 记录允许
  Runtime -> Executor: execute(toolCall)
  Executor -> Adapter: 调用本地能力
  Adapter --> Executor: 返回结果
  Executor --> Runtime: 工具结果
else Level 2 需要模块授权
  Gate -> Audit: 记录需授权
  Gate --> Runtime: requestApproval
  Runtime --> Chat: 展示确认
else Level 3/4 默认拒绝或强确认
  Gate -> Audit: 记录拒绝
  Gate --> Runtime: permission denied
  Runtime --> Chat: 展示拒绝原因
end

Runtime -> Audit: 记录最终结果

@enduml
